# Embedded Learning Log

## Hardware & Toolchain
- Board: STM32F103ZET6
- Environment: VS Code + Keil MDK 5 + STM32CubeMX

## Experiment Log

### 1. LED On (LED_TEST)
- Date: 2026-09-09
- Goal: Light up the on-board LED
- Implementation:
  - PF8 configured as open-drain output (GPIO_MODE_OUTPUT_OD) via CubeMX
  - `HAL_GPIO_WritePin(GPIOF, GPIO_PIN_8, GPIO_PIN_RESET)` drives PF8 low to turn the LED on
- Result: LED stays on after flashing

## Repository Notes
- `Drivers/` (HAL/CMSIS libraries) is not tracked; regenerate the project with CubeMX to restore it
- `*.ioc` is the CubeMX project configuration and must be tracked
